      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们一大早就充满活力。\n我看着那些逐渐远离的背影，\n在心里替她们加油。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad9790d884b9191603745245ec0327a449f9a2408972034d6a3fff133431ddc",
